// @run
// @log "hi"
// @log other
// CONTRACT (must-RUN): D932. A statically-false `is` arm whose body USES the narrowed
// value must be PRUNED per monomorphized instance, not emitted. The guard was already
// decided statically (soundness.md: "`is T` on the per-call concrete type is decided
// statically at codegen") and the condition folded to `i32.const 0` — but the arm's
// body still emitted, and its narrowed `"\"" + v + "\""` read a string ref out of the
// i32 instance's scalar cell: `vl check` rc 0, invalid wasm ("expected (ref $type),
// found i32"). The skip reads the EMITTED condition (`emittedCondConst`), so it cannot
// disagree with the test the module carries.
function show(v): string {
  if v is string { return "\"" + v + "\"" }
  return "other"
}

print(show("hi"))
print(show(5))
